#30
#MOBFORMAT dynamic
Name shadow servant~
ShD a Shadow Servant~
LnD A mass of dark shadow writhes and coalesces into a vaguely humanoid shape.
~
Desc The hair on the back of your neck shifts, telling you
someone or something is watching you. You scan your
surroundings and see nothing but darkness and shadows.
Fear sends it's icy fingers up and down your spine as
you catch slight movement through the corner of your
eye. You turn to try and find the source and see
nothing but shadows.... the shadows! A darker spot
in the shadows shifts and wriths, reaching out to you,
reaching out to blacken your soul.
~
Race shadow~
